:_5","Kubernetes self-managed",{"_22":258,"_29":41,"_24":256,"_35":259,"_44":-7,"_12":260,"_46":261},"es:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_48":262},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_22":264,"_29":41,"_24":265,"_35":266,"_44":-7,"_12":13,"_46":267},"es:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Instala con Helm","Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes.",{"_48":268},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_22":270,"_29":41,"_24":271,"_35":272,"_44":-7,"_12":273,"_46":274},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_48":275},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_22":277,"_29":41,"_24":278,"_35":279,"_44":-7,"_12":280,"_46":281},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_48":282},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_22":284,"_29":52,"_44":-7,"_24":285},"es:_6","Otros modelos",{"_22":287,"_29":41,"_24":288,"_35":289,"_44":-7,"_12":290,"_46":291},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_48":292},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_22":294,"_29":41,"_24":295,"_35":296,"_44":-7,"_12":297,"_46":298},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/es/deployment/saas",{"_48":299},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_240":302},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/images/kube